{
  "slug": "cv-skills",
  "name": "Cv Skills",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Skills for performing classical image processing operations: format conversion, SVG rendering, resize/crop/rotate, color adjustment, filters, segmentation/morphology, and compositing/blending",
  "longDescription": "Ships **7 skills** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (7): `color-adjust` (Adjust brightness, contrast, gamma, saturation, and color balance; convert to grayscale or between color spaces; split/merge channels; compute…), `edges-masks` (Threshold images, detect edges, apply morphological operations, find contours, segment by color, and extract foreground masks with GrabCut), `image-combine` (Composite, blend, overlay, and paste images together; add text or image watermarks; compute visual difference maps; remove backgrounds), `image-filters` (Blur, sharpen, denoise, and apply edge-preserving bilateral filters), `image-format` (Convert between image formats (PNG, JPEG, WebP, TIFF, BMP, HEIC), inspect image metadata, handle alpha/transparency, manage EXIF and…), `resize-transform` (Resize, crop, pad, rotate, flip, and arrange images into grids), `svg-convert` (Render SVG vector files to raster images (PNG, JPEG, WebP) at any scale or size, and inspect SVG…)\n- **Hooks** (1): `PreToolUse`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install cv-skills@claude-community` from `garg-aayush/cv-skills`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 7,
    "hook": 1
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
